{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b311fe14-3240-8719-ae45-2e30d73343ef",
  "created_at": "2025-12-19T17:05:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Joao Souza",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:02:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:02:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Hello. I am calling about the storm drain. The storm drain, on my corner. Can you hear me okay? I'm on my cell and it's not good here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:02:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Little bit choppy but I've got you. Which corner are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:02:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One-fifteen Bridge Street, in the Point. The drain at the corner is full. Full, to the top. Nothing is going down. [line breaks up] Since yesterday, nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:02:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, one-fifteen Bridge Street, drain at the corner full to the top, not draining. That's from the rain Wednesday into Thursday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:02:48-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the soaker, Wednesday and Thursday. And the water, it came up the whole street. My car, it went in that water and it stalled. Stalled! I had to get a tow, and the tow cost me real money. Real money."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:03:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, that's rough. Sorry about the car. Let me put down that the vehicle stalled in the standing water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:03:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I want to know one thing. When did they last come by? When did anybody last clean that drain? Because I have never seen a truck. Never."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:03:20-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have a cleaning date in front of me for that particular drain. I can put in the request and ask the crew supervisor to get you that answer. Is this number a good one to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:03:34-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-one. [inaudible] And I am telling you, if nobody does something, I will take the city to small claims court. Small claims. For the tow, for the car. I am not joking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:03:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Zero-one-six-one, I've got it. I'll note the tow and that you're considering a claim. For that part you'd want to go through the city clerk's office, and I can give you that department if you like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:04:00-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just fix the drain first. That is what I want. The drain. I'm out of the house now, I'm at the post office, I'm buying stamps, and the stamps, [pause] the price of stamps, I couldn't believe it. And my street is a lake. Everything costs money, except the city fixing a drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:04:19-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, stamps aren't cheap. Okay, I'm entering this as a blocked drain with flooding at the corner of one-fifteen Bridge, flagged because of the car damage. It's Friday evening, so it'll go to the crew first thing when the office reopens, and if it's an emergency tonight you'd call the main line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:04:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is an emergency for my street. Okay. You will call me back? About when they last came?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:04:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll ask them to. No promise on the day, but it's on the ticket with your number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:04:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Okay. Thank you, Kevin. Please, someone must come. [line breaks up]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T17:04:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Take care, and stay clear of that water."
    }
  ],
